sues/comments/3698436377","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114251#issuecomment-3698436377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114251","id":3698436377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ccakZ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-30T06:35:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-30T06:35:56Z","body":"I would say this PR is a net improvement for 2 reasons:\r\n1. We shouldn't be using new/delete whenever we can avoid it since it avoids our memory allocator entirely and puts us at the mercy of the OS/runtime\r\n2. It follows our goal of having 0 run time allocations\r\n\r\nUltimately this will never make a noticeable performance difference since the code only runs when the camera feed is activated. Even if it did take a few ms, it would be hidden by the activation of the camera. \r\n\r\nThat being said, I think it is important to avoid new/delete so that this code doesn't get copied and spread elsewhere since this is a dangerous pattern. Some code patterns are best to simply avoid in new code, but this is one that I think is worth removing from any place we spot it since if we accumulate a lot of new/deletes we will create a huge future headache. \r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3698436377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3698437415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114251#issuecomment-3698437415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114251","id":3698437415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cca0n","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-30T06:36:42Z","updated_at":"2025-12-30T06:36:42Z","body":"Looks great! The final step before merging is to squash all the commits together so that the whole PR only contains 1 big commit with all your changes. We like to merge one commit at a time to keep the git history clean and navigable. It looks like you accidentally added a merge commi